60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"The options are Seasonal Fixed Rate, Per-Room Metering, or Flat Household Share. I'm voting for the Seasonal Fixed Rate.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Per-room metering is too expensive upfront. Flat share is too volatile. I vote for Seasonal Fixed Rate.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,Metering is too much work to manage. I vote for Seasonal Fixed Rate.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"While I prefer the fairness of metering, the cost and effort make it impractical. I vote for Seasonal Fixed Rate.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Flat share is what we basically have, and it's causing the tension. I vote for Seasonal Fixed Rate.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
